ussian Roulette, Spin the Bottle, card-based bluffing, and more. Ready to go feral?\n{1956211188619923}\n\n# \ud83c\udf81 Freely Customize Skins and Trinkets\ud83c\udf81\nCustomize to your heart's content, from luxurious skins to an arsenal of guns and trinkets!\n{1498700681601524}\n\n# \ud83e\uddf1A Multitude of Madness-Filled Stages\ud83e\uddf1\nBattle across numerous stunning stages with unique gimmicks, including some exclusive to specific game modes!\n{1234423705440375}\n\n# \ud83d\udcac Join the Discord!!\nCheck our Discord for the latest news, player interactions, free skin giveaways, and more!\n\nhttps://mydearest.net/DevilsRoulette-BazookaDiscord\n{1265613525112501}", "short_description": "Devil's Roulette -The Pit- is a thrilling VR party game for 1 to 4 players, featuring a variety of high-stakes game modes including Russian Roulette, Spin the Bottle, card-based bluffing, and more. Ready to go feral?\n"}]}, "developer_name": "Bazooka Studio", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://mydearestvr.com/en/privacypolicy/devilsroulette.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "MyDearest Inc.", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://mydearestvr.com/en/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1676485315806614"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1700921480735423"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["CASUAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "271